                                              TirePressureFormat port (no KMP/Shared dep)
  Verbatim web logic ported + unit-pinned:
    TIRE_PRESSURE_PA = {206800, 241300, 310300, 344700} Pa · paToKpa = pa/1000 (null/NaN→nil) ·
    variant: <LOW_CRITICAL||>HIGH_CRITICAL→danger; <LOW_WARNING||>HIGH_WARNING→warning; else
    success; nil→neutral (web getColor/getBorder) · verdict: allGood(every corner finite & in
    [LOW_WARNING,HIGH_WARNING]) ? allNormal : anyBad(any finite & outside critical) ? attention :
    checkPressure (web ternary precedence) · formatPressure: convertPressureFromSI(kPa,unit)
    {kPa|psi=/6.894757|bar=/100}, precision 1, locale grouping, null→'—' (web default unit 'bar').
  Web Tailwind → native tokens (ADR-006 semantic): green→statusSuccess, amber→statusWarning,
    red→statusDanger, --text-muted→textMuted; card border = same tone @30% (web border-*-500/30);
    glass card → TSGlassPanel. Badge symbols ✓/✗/⚠ → SF Symbols (checkmark.circle.fill /
    xmark.octagon.fill / exclamationmark.triangle.fill) + localized word (no glyph in i18n).
  States (all render, never a blank box): loading(skeleton 2×2 + badge) · empty(web "No tire
    pressure data available") · error(+retry) · data(grid+verdict) · stale(chip+one auto-refresh)
    · offline(cached+chip) — the P4 freshness envelope around the web `tireData ? grid : noData`.
